    "description_html": "<p><strong>Professional and Durable!</strong></p>\n<p>Elevate your brand with our Metal Name Tags &amp; Custom Name Badges, designed to combine vibrant full-color printing with durability and customization. Perfect for executives and professionals in corporate industries such as banking, real estate, and legal sectors, these name badges offer a sleek and polished look. Looking for other styles and finishes? Browse our full range of <a href=\"%%GLOBAL_ShopPathSSL%%/name-badges/metal-name-badges/\">custom metal name badges</a>.</p>\n<p>Our Metal Name Badges include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Full-Color Printing</strong>: Enjoy vibrant, full-color printing of logos and text, ensuring your brand stands out.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Metallic Borders</strong>: Available in Silver or Gold metallic borders, adding a touch of elegance and sophistication.</li>\n<li><strong>Magnet Fastener</strong>: Secure and easy-to-use magnet fasteners for convenient attachment.</li>\n<li><strong>Scratch and Fade-Proof Coating</strong>: Our badges feature a durable polyurethane coating that protects against scratches and fading, ensuring they look great for a long time.</li>\n<li><strong>Rapid Production Times</strong>: Benefit from quick turnaround times, ensuring you receive your badges promptly.</li>\n<li><strong>No Setup Fees &amp; No Design Fees</strong>: Start your order without any additional setup or design costs.</li>\n<li><strong>Quantity-Based Prices</strong>: Enjoy competitive pricing with discounts based on order quantity.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Ideal for Executives and Corporate Professionals</strong>: Our executive metal name badges and tags are perfect for those in professional industries such as banking, real estate, and legal sectors. They provide a polished and professional appearance, making a lasting impression.</p>\n<p><strong>Order Your Metal Name Tags Today!</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Make a lasting impression with vibrant, durable, and customizable name badges. Perfect for businesses, events, and organizations, these badges offer a professional look with the added benefit of durability. Click the \"Buy Now\" button and elevate your brand with our Metal Name Tags &amp; Custom Name Badges!</p>"
